      "title": "Naive - Hire Autonomous Employees that actually run your company.",
      "tagline": "Describe your business. Naive runs it. ",
      "body": "<https://youtu.be/qYzbzuBmqDo>\\\n\\\nNaïve is an autonomous company runtime. \\\n\\\nYou describe your business — or connect your existing one — and Naïve deploys AI employees that actually execute.\n\n1. Our employees have their own identity. Own bank account, own email, own credentials, own compute. \n2. They sign up for tools, pay for services, deploy apps, and file documents as themselves. No human in the loop.\n3. They  learn recursively. Every output, every result gets stored. They extract patterns about YOUR business and compound performance week over week.\n\n**New companies** — describe what you want, Naïve builds and runs it. \\\n\\\n**Existing companies** — one-click connect your stack (CRM, codebase, Shopify, Notion, whatever), Naïve employees plug in day one.\\\n\\\n**Get Started for FREE + YC Deal**\\\n\\\nFree to get started, pay as you go.\\\nWe also have a YC deal! \n\n[usenaive.ai](http://usenaive.ai)\\\n$100 Off for YC Alum: <https://bookface.ycombinator.com/deals/3819>",
